1
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>是御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:10,978 --> 00:00:13,773
<c.simplifiedchinese>天下无双的御庭番众 一员</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:16,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>本大爷就是火男！</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:18,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>火男？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个名字太可爱了 不适合你</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:20,248 --> 00:00:21,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>改个名吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:22,543 --> 00:00:24,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>乖乖地把惠交出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:24,965 --> 00:00:27,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还能放你们一马</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:28,305 --> 00:00:30,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁先上？</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:30,393 --> 00:00:33,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们一起上也没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:33,148 --> 00:00:36,485
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙看起来
对自己的赤手空拳的力量很自傲</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:36,572 --> 00:00:38,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>交给我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:38,117 --> 00:00:40,744
<c.simplifiedchinese>对手可是御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:42,999
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕没有表面上那么简单…</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:43,085 --> 00:00:44,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:44,337 --> 00:00:46,965
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要活捉他 问出鸦片的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>你先来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:00:52,478 --> 00:00:56,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管力量多强
打不到对手都没有意义</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:00:57,905 --> 00:00:59,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:00:59,576 --> 00:01:02,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>特意走进了我的攻击范围</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:04,669 --> 00:01:05,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:26,296 --> 00:01:29,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:44,661 --> 00:02:45,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:48,335 --> 00:02:49,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:53,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:54,806 --> 00:02:57,517
<c.simplifiedchinese>玩火多危险啊 你这混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:58,104 --> 00:02:59,146
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:02:59,231 --> 00:03:02,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然躲开了我的必杀技火焰吐息</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:02,905 --> 00:03:06,826
<c.simplifiedchinese>但拖着那样的腿
你还能躲开下一次吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:09,836 --> 00:03:12,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>用藏在胃里的油袋
和火石做的假牙来点火</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:12,842 --> 00:03:16,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可是御庭番众中最强的火术师</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:16,433 --> 00:03:19,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>“火男”这个名字就是因此而来</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:19,814 --> 00:03:21,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有他烧不掉的东西！</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:25,951 --> 00:03:27,077
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:30,126 --> 00:03:31,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在东张西望什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:31,713 --> 00:03:33,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下才是你的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34,844 --> 00:03:37,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>我先收拾他</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:37,182 --> 00:03:40,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>别着急 下一个就是你</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:40,522 --> 00:03:45,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种街头杂耍
根本连在下的一根头发都烧不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:45,407 --> 00:03:48,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>街…街头杂耍？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:52,463 --> 00:03:56,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然用逆刃刀斩断了火焰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:00,562 --> 00:04:01,438
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:01,523 --> 00:04:04,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>以为区区一把刀就能抵挡火焰吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:07,493 --> 00:04:08,744
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:09,747 --> 00:04:13,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心在为你而战</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:13,212 --> 00:04:16,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>你应该在这里好好看着</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:16,928 --> 00:04:19,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>面对那种对手 剑客可没法获胜</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:23,896
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算可以拖延一些时间
对手毕竟是御庭番众的中等密探</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:24,569 --> 00:04:27,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟低等密探恶见可不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:27,616 --> 00:04:28,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 他会赢</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:29,662 --> 00:04:31,789
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不了解剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:32,459 --> 00:04:36,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是一名剑客 但不是普通的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:38,179 --> 00:04:40,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么可能…五升油全用完了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:42,353 --> 00:04:43,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:44,274 --> 00:04:46,610
<c.simplifiedchinese>你连在下的一根头发都烧不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:48,115 --> 00:04:50,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然真的用刀防住了火焰</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:51,288 --> 00:04:52,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:52,248 --> 00:04:53,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不是普通的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:54,419 --> 00:04:56,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>他到底是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:59,137 --> 00:05:00,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:00,473 --> 00:05:02,308
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没结束呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:03,104 --> 00:05:04,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想要补充燃料！</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:06,276 --> 00:05:07,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:07,529 --> 00:05:09,489
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你帮我</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:10,076 --> 00:05:12,703
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过他的对手是我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:13,499 --> 00:05:16,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 让我再来一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:18,593 --> 00:05:19,845
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:19,929 --> 00:05:21,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来就交给你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:21,724 --> 00:05:23,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>包在我身上</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:23,937 --> 00:05:27,190
<c.simplifiedchinese>等等 你们两个耍什么帅啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:27,277 --> 00:05:29,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>补充完成</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:29,239 --> 00:05:31,074
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:34,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>再来也只会被我烧死</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:34,709 --> 00:05:36,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才是蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:36,963 --> 00:05:41,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>同一个把戏会生效两次吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:42,265 --> 00:05:43,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要烧死你</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:44,019 --> 00:05:49,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然说本大爷的得意技能
是街头杂耍…</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:49,195 --> 00:05:51,948
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你们一个个全都烧成灰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:52,953 --> 00:05:54,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>超大火焰吐息！</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:05:54,707 --> 00:05:56,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次他们无路可逃了</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:05:56,543 --> 00:05:58,086
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃我一拳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:05:59,299 --> 00:06:00,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:02,263 --> 00:06:04,098
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是乱来啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:04,184 --> 00:06:07,312
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是所谓置之死地而后生</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:07,398 --> 00:06:10,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你这下还怎么喷火！</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:11,156 --> 00:06:15,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么引以为傲的技能
这装油的袋子真是脏死了</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:16,834 --> 00:06:18,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经没有胜算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:18,964 --> 00:06:21,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>老实投降吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:22,387 --> 00:06:23,805
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:24,307 --> 00:06:27,060
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才是没有胜算的那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:27,146 --> 00:06:31,526
<c.simplifiedchinese>双臂都被烧伤
你没法像刚才那样出拳了</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:31,613 --> 00:06:36,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>像火焰一样燃烧吧 吃我的火炎拳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:38,335 --> 00:06:41,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架时还可以踢人</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:41,258 --> 00:06:45,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的腿这么短 难怪根本想不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:50,067 --> 00:06:51,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>轻松获胜！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:06:52,196 --> 00:06:55,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>但换来满身伤痕</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:06:55,327 --> 00:06:58,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你说什么！
-赢了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:06:58,333 --> 00:07:01,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎么说 他们还是很强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:01,883 --> 00:07:04,093
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不仅仅是强了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:04,596 --> 00:07:06,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们俩到底是什么人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:06,934 --> 00:07:08,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:10,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不了解他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:10,691 --> 00:07:13,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是我可以依赖</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>又引以为傲的伙伴</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:14,657 --> 00:07:15,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>别傻笑了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:15,827 --> 00:07:17,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:17,163 --> 00:07:20,124
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的浑身是伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:20,211 --> 00:07:21,921
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉只是险胜</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:22,006 --> 00:07:23,299
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:23,384 --> 00:07:24,885
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:24,970 --> 00:07:27,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂
-这可是轻而易举</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:29,187 --> 00:07:30,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>伙伴…</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:31,901 --> 00:07:34,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙该怎么处理？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:34,447 --> 00:07:37,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 要么往他身上泼点水…</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:39,082 --> 00:07:40,750
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死…</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:40,836 --> 00:07:43,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>火男这蠢货竟然被轻易打倒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:43,715 --> 00:07:47,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是又要失败了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:49,018 --> 00:07:50,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:50,396 --> 00:07:52,440
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一切全是因为高荷惠！</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:52,525 --> 00:07:56,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不是我负责监视的时候
让你跑掉了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:56,616 --> 00:07:58,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我受了这么多罪</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:58,787 --> 00:08:01,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不能这么放过你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:02,462 --> 00:08:03,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:05,258
<c.simplifiedchinese>有杀气！</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:05,342 --> 00:08:06,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>小心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:06,428 --> 00:08:08,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有人潜伏在附近！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:08,182 --> 00:08:09,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>-在那！
-去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:13,609 --> 00:08:14,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>小心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:15,738 --> 00:08:16,655
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:17,783 --> 00:08:18,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:18,702 --> 00:08:21,205
<c.simplifiedchinese>这孩子真是乱来</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:21,291 --> 00:08:22,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>疼…</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:22,293 --> 00:08:24,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里很危险 你快退下！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:24,422 --> 00:08:26,382
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:26,468 --> 00:08:27,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不知道为什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:27,803 --> 00:08:30,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>但剑心和左之助
不是在保护这个女人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:30,267 --> 00:08:33,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也是剑心组的一员！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:33,148 --> 00:08:36,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然没法对敌 但至少帮忙防守！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:37,031 --> 00:08:40,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>对自己的门生再有点信心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:41,999 --> 00:08:42,917
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:08:43,794 --> 00:08:44,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:08:45,548 --> 00:08:46,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>有毒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:08:48,178 --> 00:08:49,805
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:08:49,889 --> 00:08:52,308
<c.simplifiedchinese>那小鬼最多活不过一小时了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:08:52,395 --> 00:08:54,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>毒杀螺旋镖！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:08:54,566 --> 00:08:58,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是御庭番众恶见的真正武器！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:00,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一个就是你这个红发混蛋…</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:13,395 --> 00:09:14,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>出现了</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:14,647 --> 00:09:15,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:15,941 --> 00:09:16,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:17,069 --> 00:09:18,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:18,363 --> 00:09:20,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 醒醒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:21,328 --> 00:09:22,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:22,955 --> 00:09:24,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:31,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:37,068 --> 00:09:38,235
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:42,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来继续打下去
也没法夺回高荷惠了</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:09:43,497 --> 00:09:49,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只想把他们俩带走
尽快回去向首领复命</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:09:49,967 --> 00:09:52,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>是你们先挑起的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:09:52,348 --> 00:09:53,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不会阻止你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:09:53,934 --> 00:09:58,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是那个小个子要留在这
交出弥彦的解毒剂</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:09:58,443 --> 00:10:01,321
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于敌人我没有这种义务</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:01,408 --> 00:10:04,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎样都要留下他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:07,211 --> 00:10:10,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷漠的表情下竟是个性情中人</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:15,227 --> 00:10:21,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要你们还窝藏高荷惠
总有一天我们会再次交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:21,281 --> 00:10:23,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>到那时再分胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:25,581 --> 00:10:26,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>那身法…</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:29,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是久经修炼的拳法家</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:30,841 --> 00:10:32,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！弥彦他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:33,138 --> 00:10:34,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:10:36,144 --> 00:10:37,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:10:37,646 --> 00:10:40,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>处理刀枪伤和骨折的经验在下都有</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:10:40,694 --> 00:10:42,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是解毒…</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:10:42,698 --> 00:10:45,242
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之 先把毒从伤口里吸出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:10:45,329 --> 00:10:47,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>-明白了
-住手</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:10:49,212 --> 00:10:51,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>想让我对弥彦见死不救吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:10:51,633 --> 00:10:53,635
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你别管！
-傻瓜！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:58,433
<c.simplifiedchinese>用嘴吸出毒素要是引起了细菌感染
反而会让伤势恶化</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:10:59,022 --> 00:11:01,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>外行人别插手 都退下</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:04,242 --> 00:11:06,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>意识不明 低烧…</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:06,204 --> 00:11:09,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>轻微疼痛 瞳孔扩大</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:09,836 --> 00:11:12,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是曼陀罗叶的毒素</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:13,426 --> 00:11:17,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘 这里是道场
一定有熟悉的大夫吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:17,518 --> 00:11:20,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>我写下药方 你现在去找他抓药</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:20,315 --> 00:11:22,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑 去烧一些开水</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:22,151 --> 00:11:24,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>再拿点干净的白布来</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:24,532 --> 00:11:27,410
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们去买冰块 能买多少买多少</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:11:27,496 --> 00:11:29,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>解毒就是跟时间赛跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:11:30,042 --> 00:11:31,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:11:34,175 --> 00:11:35,051
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:11:35,136 --> 00:11:36,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就行了</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:11:37,015 --> 00:11:40,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来三、四天他就能恢复</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:11:40,104 --> 00:11:43,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:11:43,152 --> 00:11:45,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>前提是让他安静养病…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:11:46,284 --> 00:11:49,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢啦 老头 你还挺厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:11:49,957 --> 00:11:52,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>对老人一点也不尊重</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:55,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>要谢就谢开药方的人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:11:55,761 --> 00:11:57,638
<c.simplifiedchinese>了不起的药方</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:11:57,723 --> 00:12:02,102
<c.simplifiedchinese>解毒剂的材料和做法都写得十分清楚</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:02,190 --> 00:12:03,691
<c.simplifiedchinese>开药方的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:03,777 --> 00:12:09,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>必然精通兰学
用现在的说法 就是西方医学</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:09,330 --> 00:12:12,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许只是对毒药很了解呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:12,753 --> 00:12:15,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>毒和药只有一线之差</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:15,425 --> 00:12:19,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果合理使用曼陀罗的叶子
也可以是强力的良药</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>写药方的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:12:21,228 --> 00:12:24,147
<c.simplifiedchinese>是个精通西方医学的高手</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:12:24,234 --> 00:12:25,735
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其了解药物的药性</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:12:25,821 --> 00:12:27,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>惊呆了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:12:27,741 --> 00:12:30,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为她只是个性格恶劣的女人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:12:30,539 --> 00:12:32,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>女人？难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:12:33,001 --> 00:12:34,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>是高荷惠？</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:12:35,297 --> 00:12:36,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道她？</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:12:37,218 --> 00:12:38,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:12:38,888 --> 00:12:44,102
<c.simplifiedchinese>三年前有一名大夫被杀
她是那大夫的助手</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:12:49,577 --> 00:12:51,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要去哪里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:12:52,624 --> 00:12:54,752
<c.simplifiedchinese>女性深夜在外走动很危险的</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:12:54,837 --> 00:12:57,965
<c.simplifiedchinese>真让人心脏受不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:12:59,012 --> 00:13:01,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个少年现在情况如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:01,434 --> 00:13:03,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>他很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:03,103 --> 00:13:06,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦是个很坚强的孩子</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:06,903 --> 00:13:08,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你的治疗</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:08,907 --> 00:13:11,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下代他向你说声谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:11,203 --> 00:13:13,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>道谢就不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:13,458 --> 00:13:15,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟恶见是冲着我来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:15,921 --> 00:13:18,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:19,093 --> 00:13:20,804
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然没被岔开话题</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:13:21,474 --> 00:13:23,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之我要离开东京</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:13:23,853 --> 00:13:26,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>碍事的人很快就会离开了 别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:13:27,068 --> 00:13:31,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>在你的家乡会津有人在等你吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:13:32,704 --> 00:13:37,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>乡音难改 你说的是会津方言</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:13:38,048 --> 00:13:39,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下幕末时</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:13:39,635 --> 00:13:44,557
<c.simplifiedchinese>在东京跟很多会津武士交过手
因此能听出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:13:47,024 --> 00:13:50,528
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真让人心脏受不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:13:51,491 --> 00:13:55,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多是时候说出实情了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:13:57,128 --> 00:14:02,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩的高荷一家是有名的医学世家</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:03,558 --> 00:14:04,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷一家</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:04,685 --> 00:14:08,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论女人还是小孩都学习医术
是十分罕见的家族</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:08,735 --> 00:14:10,069
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然身为御医</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:10,154 --> 00:14:16,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>却不论病人身份
都全心全意为他们诊治</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:17,961 --> 00:14:19,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:19,088 --> 00:14:23,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>严格遵守身份等级秩序的武士来说
他们是令人讨厌的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:23,556 --> 00:14:28,686
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对我们从医者来说却是理想的榜样</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:28,775 --> 00:14:32,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠的父亲高荷隆生更是如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:14:33,492 --> 00:14:35,911
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说了西医的惊人效果后</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:14:35,997 --> 00:14:41,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>他突然脱藩
带着全家去长崎学习西医</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:14:41,549 --> 00:14:44,552
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时这要鼓起多大勇气</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:47,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的年轻人不会明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:14:48,563 --> 00:14:49,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:14:49,482 --> 00:14:54,028
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们一家收到了
返回会津的特别许可 几乎同时</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:14:54,117 --> 00:14:56,369
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津战争爆发了</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:14:57,540 --> 00:14:59,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津战争</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:14:59,252 --> 00:15:02,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>是发生在会津藩和维新政府军之间的</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:02,383 --> 00:15:05,761
<c.simplifiedchinese>戊辰战争的第四场战役</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:05,849 --> 00:15:08,643
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩不论男女老少全力奋战</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:08,730 --> 00:15:12,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而城池被围</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:12,111 --> 00:15:14,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终于1868年9月22日投降</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:15,242 --> 00:15:16,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治维新前</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:16,453 --> 00:15:18,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩担任守护京都的职务</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:18,833 --> 00:15:21,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>镇压维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:21,588 --> 00:15:22,881
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:22,966 --> 00:15:25,552
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩人民在此后许多年里</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:15:25,637 --> 00:15:28,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>受到了新政府的不合理镇压</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:15:29,604 --> 00:15:30,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷一家</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:15:30,857 --> 00:15:34,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>只留下年幼的惠
就投身战场做了军医</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:15:35,032 --> 00:15:37,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>隆生死在了战场上</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:15:37,119 --> 00:15:40,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠的母亲和两个兄弟下落不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:15:41,503 --> 00:15:46,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>那之后 惠就一个人孤孤单单的</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:48,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>五年前</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:15:48,851 --> 00:15:52,605
<c.simplifiedchinese>她来到东京 成为了某个大夫的助手</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:15:53,110 --> 00:15:57,656
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟那名大夫很熟悉 就知道了惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:15:57,744 --> 00:16:01,373
<c.simplifiedchinese>那名大夫三年前被杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:01,459 --> 00:16:04,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>那之后她就下落不明了</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:05,509 --> 00:16:07,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很想跟惠姑娘见一面</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:07,721 --> 00:16:09,098
<c.simplifiedchinese>她现在在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:10,436 --> 00:16:13,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么说是啊 刚才就没看见她了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:13,650 --> 00:16:16,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个女人 该不会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:17,909 --> 00:16:21,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>五年前 我还不会看人</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:16:22,126 --> 00:16:24,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>那名大夫暗中和观柳狼狈为奸</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:16:25,674 --> 00:16:28,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳买来廉价的鸦片原料</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:16:28,430 --> 00:16:31,683
<c.simplifiedchinese>大夫进行提炼 观柳再拿去卖</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:16:32,271 --> 00:16:34,190
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们一直合作的很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:16:35,194 --> 00:16:37,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到大夫做出了这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:16:38,533 --> 00:16:40,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家称它为“蜘蛛网”</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:16:40,621 --> 00:16:42,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>采用了特别的提炼方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:16:42,124 --> 00:16:46,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用了平时原料的一半
上瘾性却是原来的两倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:16:46,299 --> 00:16:48,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说能赚到四倍的利润</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:16:48,803 --> 00:16:50,305
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果真的流通开</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:16:50,390 --> 00:16:53,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用五年就能让整个东京都染上毒瘾</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:16:53,647 --> 00:16:56,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要大量贩卖的观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:16:56,277 --> 00:16:58,738
<c.simplifiedchinese>想从大夫那里问出提炼方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:16:58,823 --> 00:17:02,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>但大夫想独占利益 不肯说</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:02,958 --> 00:17:07,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们争吵起来
观柳他们失手把大夫杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:07,968 --> 00:17:09,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为他的助手</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:09,262 --> 00:17:12,431
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是唯一知道制造方法的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:12,518 --> 00:17:14,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就被逼着继续制药</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:17:16,568 --> 00:17:20,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>当我意识到这不是救人性命的药</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:17:20,158 --> 00:17:24,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是害人的毒品 我想到了死</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:17:24,667 --> 00:17:28,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我不能死</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:17:29,468 --> 00:17:31,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要我活着…还在行医…</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:17:32,016 --> 00:17:33,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>总有一天在什么地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:17:33,852 --> 00:17:37,939
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能再见到我失踪的母亲和哥哥…</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:17:38,570 --> 00:17:40,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着这一点希望…</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:17:40,324 --> 00:17:44,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>害人的药我做了三年…</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:17:48,256 --> 00:17:50,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳追着惠小姐不放</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:17:50,552 --> 00:17:54,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是说没有其他人知道制作方法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:57,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一定尽力抑制“蜘蛛网”的生产</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:17:57,984 --> 00:18:00,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>最大限度的减少受害者的数量</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:00,739 --> 00:18:05,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>把情感压抑在心里
自己默默背负一切 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:07,252 --> 00:18:10,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经受了三年的折磨</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:10,384 --> 00:18:13,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候得到原谅 获得自由了</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:15,268 --> 00:18:16,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:17,231 --> 00:18:20,275
<c.simplifiedchinese>那群人没那么容易甩掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:20,779 --> 00:18:23,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>最好在道场再待一些日子吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:23,368 --> 00:18:24,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:18:24,870 --> 00:18:26,872
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以吧 薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:18:36,185 --> 00:18:37,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:18:37,438 --> 00:18:39,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白孤身一人的痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:18:40,736 --> 00:18:42,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果不是有剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:18:42,364 --> 00:18:44,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可能会经历一样的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:18:44,744 --> 00:18:48,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来 只要想办法对付观柳就好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:18:49,712 --> 00:18:53,507
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是 你千万不能对剑心出手哟</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:18:53,595 --> 00:18:56,431
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然我一定毫不客气地把你扫地出门</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:04,408 --> 00:19:05,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:05,952 --> 00:19:08,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见和火男暂时用不上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:10,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:10,378 --> 00:19:14,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若 你的伤没事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:14,595 --> 00:19:15,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:15,597 --> 00:19:16,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>勉强算是</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:17,518 --> 00:19:22,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>正如首领所说 他不是泛泛之辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:22,152 --> 00:19:23,195
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:19:23,279 --> 00:19:25,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>他接下我的拳时</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:19:25,867 --> 00:19:31,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁机打向了我的要害部位肝脏</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:19:32,256 --> 00:19:33,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>还能战斗吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:19:33,299 --> 00:19:38,263
<c.simplifiedchinese>两、三天内不行 但可以收集情报</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:19:38,351 --> 00:19:39,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>那好</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:19:39,645 --> 00:19:41,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>三天内 查清楚那个男人的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:19:42,192 --> 00:19:43,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:46,533
<c.simplifiedchinese>红发…</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:19:47,034 --> 00:19:48,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>十字刀疤…</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:19:49,206 --> 00:19:50,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人果然是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:21:32,078 --> 00:21:33,412
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎登船</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:21:33,498 --> 00:21:34,624
<c.simplifiedchinese>船长在等您</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:21:34,708 --> 00:21:36,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:21:36,294 --> 00:21:40,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说：“欢迎登船 船长在等您”</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:21:41,221 --> 00:21:43,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>好殷勤的招待</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:21:43,851 --> 00:21:46,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是金钱的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:21:48,903 --> 00:21:50,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 观柳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:21:51,074 --> 00:21:53,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>很高兴看到你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:21:53,328 --> 00:21:56,081
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 你好 非常幸运！</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:21:57,169 --> 00:22:00,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么船长 货呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

351
00:22:00,092 --> 00:22:01,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么船长 货呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

352
00:22:01,887 --> 00:22:04,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 跟我来</c.simplifiedchinese>

353
00:22:09,486 --> 00:22:10,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

354
00:22:10,864 --> 00:22:12,907
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 打开？</c.simplifiedchinese>

355
00:22:20,466 --> 00:22:22,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>漂亮又优雅</c.simplifiedchinese>

356
00:22:22,512 --> 00:22:24,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了这个我就无敌了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

357
00:22:25,100 --> 00:22:26,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎来到日本！</c.simplifiedchinese>

358
00:22:26,937 --> 00:22:29,481
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在所有人都要向我臣服！</c.simplifiedchinese>

359
00:22:30,068 --> 00:22:31,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>这都是多亏了钱！</c.simplifiedchinese>

360
00:22:31,989 --> 00:22:33,657
<c.simplifiedchinese>金钱的力量！</c.simplifiedchinese>

361
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>有钱的感觉真爽！</c.simplifiedchinese>

362
00:22:36,790 --> 00:22:38,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 观柳…</c.simplifiedchinese>

363
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:41,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是太棒了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

364
00:22:47,812 --> 00:22:50,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《行动的理由》</c.simplifiedchinese>

